{
  "uid": "flotte",
  "title": "Flotte : pourquoi un carré s'éteint",
  "tags": [
    "flotte"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "1. Trafic : coups encaissés par seconde",
      "description": "Le service reçoit-il du trafic ? Un carré éteint avec du trafic qui monte, c'est la charge ; avec une courbe à plat, c'est autre chose. Les codes 5xx sont les coups ratés.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service, statut) (rate(flotte_coups_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{statut}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2. Latence de /travail (p95)",
      "description": "Répond-il, et en combien de temps ? La latence qui explose avant l'extinction désigne la saturation ; une extinction sans montée de latence désigne autre chose.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (service, le) (rate(flotte_travail_duree_secondes_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} p95",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "3. Dépendances (vert = répond)",
      "description": "Ses dépendances vont-elles bien ? base KO = panne 2 (base coupée). tableau KO alors que le service répond = panne 6 (tableau injoignable). pavillon KO = panne 3. Une ligne « répond au scrape » KO : le process est mort (panne 1, 4 ou 5).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min by (service, dependance) (flotte_dependance)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} → {{dependance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "min by (job) (up)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} répond au scrape",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "KO",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "auto",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}